    "completion": "Use each clip's completionAction. One-shot seated coffee returns to seated_idle in the same direction.",
    "frontBackTransitions": "Only lateral sit/stand transitions are drawn. For up/down stations, add a brief turn to a lateral facing, play the lateral transition, then switch to the requested seated facing; reverse that order on departure. Do not invent unprovided front/back transition frames.",
